Maren Morris added to the discourse in her own Instagram post as well, with the message &#8220;me being a wh0re at the gym&#8221; across a video of herself soundtracked by her song &#8220;be a bitch.&#8221; In the video, she throws up a middle finger to the camera and finished it off with the caption: &#8220;leave my gym short wedgie out of it.&#8221;

View this post on Instagram

Gillis hosted Saturday&#8217;s show with Rosalía as the musical guest. In addition to it being his third time hosting, Gillis was also briefly a cast member of the show, but he was dismissed soon after the announcement of his casting when previous homophobic and racist jokes of his resurfaced.

